oracle-rs is a Rust port of the parts of the Triangle.js engine that pipeline/sim/oracle-source.ts
reaches when it replays a TETR.IO .ttrm player-round. The engine it ports is vendored, unmodified, in
pipeline/sim/vendor/teto/engine (the @haelp/teto package, version 4.2.7).

